    "detailed_description": "<strong>Multiverse GO</strong> is a turn-based puzzle adventure set in a group of multiple universes. You can explore the multiverse and face challenges. The game focuses on forward thinking to progress through levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346880/extras/63f879565988e35ff5ab3f1558d818b6.poster.avif?t=1714938168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346880/extras/63f879565988e35ff5ab3f1558d818b6.webm?t=1714938168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346880/extras/63f879565988e35ff5ab3f1558d818b6.mp4?t=1714938168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Multiverse GO, you\u2019ll experience</strong> :</h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346880/extras/34faaf5acb74712bdb6874904e23a67d.poster.avif?t=1714938168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346880/extras/34faaf5acb74712bdb6874904e23a67d.webm?t=1714938168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346880/extras/34faaf5acb74712bdb6874904e23a67d.mp4?t=1714938168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Challenging puzzles that put your skills to the test.<br>- Fight or go peacefully, overcome the different types of enemies.<br>- Complete all levels and unlock new universes. <br>- Different, alive, and intriguing environments.<br>- Powerful unique bosses in each different universe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346880/extras/9c8eeff9227b242c49a9df23fd1fb774.poster.avif?t=1714938168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346880/extras/9c8eeff9227b242c49a9df23fd1fb774.webm?t=1714938168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346880/extras/9c8eeff9227b242c49a9df23fd1fb774.mp4?t=1714938168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect all the cases and learn all the secret information about the multiverse</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346880/extras/f58e2195461d8313002a354d4ff0f4aa.poster.avif?t=1714938168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346880/extras/f58e2195461d8313002a354d4ff0f4aa.webm?t=1714938168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346880/extras/f58e2195461d8313002a354d4ff0f4aa.mp4?t=1714938168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
